{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0008"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0008_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "- Describe\nhow processes\nfor identifying,\nassessing and\nmanaging\nclimate-\nrelated risks\nare integrated\ninto the\norganisation's\noverall risk\nmanagement.", "semantic_text": "- Describe how processes for identifying, assessing and managing climate-related risks are integrated into the organisation's overall risk management.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0008_geometry", "bbox": [96, 717, 223, 958], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0008"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0009", "D0010"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0009_F001", "D0010_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Addresses how\nrisk is managed by\noperating\ncompanies.", "semantic_text": "Addresses how risk is managed by\noperating companies.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [12, 1298, 214, 1353], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}, {"member_id": "D0010_geometry", "bbox": [13, 1354, 136, 1415], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0010"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0012", "D0013"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0012_F001", "D0013_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Overview of our actions\nWe have integrated climate change into our group Enterprise Risk\nManagement framework, which can be found within the Risk Management\nsection of this report. For 2024/25 this integration has been centred on\nidentifying and assessing climate-related and climate change risks.\nThis TCFD disclosure takes consideration of the NDA group approach to\nclimate risks.", "semantic_text": "Overview of our actions\nWe have integrated climate change into our group Enterprise Risk Management framework, which can be found within the Risk Management section of this report. For 2024/25 this integration has been centred on identifying and assessing climate-related and climate change risks. This TCFD disclosure takes consideration of the NDA group approach to climate risks.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0012_geometry", "bbox": [240, 304, 435, 325], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0012"}, {"member_id": "D0013_geometry", "bbox": [240, 333, 831, 454], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0013"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0014"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0014_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "This group approach continues the direction set in the TCFD 2023/24\nreport. Although the group does not recognise climate change as a Group\nStrategic Risk (GSR), several operating companies (Sellafield and NRS)\nrecognise climate change as principal threats.", "semantic_text": "This group approach continues the direction set in the TCFD 2023/24 report. Although the group does not recognise climate change as a Group Strategic Risk (GSR), several operating companies (Sellafield and NRS) recognise climate change as principal threats.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0014_geometry", "bbox": [240, 455, 828, 535], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0014"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_007", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0015"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0015_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "The next steps in climate change risk management involve continuing\nto mature the group's, NDA's, and operating companies' understanding\nof threats and opportunities presented by climate change, ultimately\nestablishing climate change risk management as a business-as-usual\npractice.", "semantic_text": "The next steps in climate change risk management involve continuing to mature the group's, NDA's, and operating companies' understanding of threats and opportunities presented by climate change, ultimately establishing climate change risk management as a business-as-usual practice.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0015_geometry", "bbox": [240, 535, 801, 635], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0015"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_008", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0016"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0016_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Risk Identification: The NDA and operating companies individually assess\ntheir climate risk exposure using the NDA group Risk Breakdown Structure\n(RBS), as detailed below. We regularly monitor policy and the regulatory\nlandscape, conduct workshops and horizon scanning to identify and\ndescribe risks.", "semantic_text": "Risk Identification: The NDA and operating companies individually assess their climate risk exposure using the NDA group Risk Breakdown Structure (RBS), as detailed below. We regularly monitor policy and the regulatory landscape, conduct workshops and horizon scanning to identify and describe risks.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0016_geometry", "bbox": [240, 635, 820, 735], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0016"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_009", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0018"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0018_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Risk Analysis: Climate risks are scored, then reviewed and prioritised against\nthe wider organisational risk landscape. This allows for understanding of the\ninterconnectivity with other risk areas, which are heightened due to climate\nrelated impacts.", "semantic_text": "Risk Analysis: Climate risks are scored, then reviewed and prioritised against the wider organisational risk landscape. This allows for understanding of the interconnectivity with other risk areas, which are heightened due to climate related impacts.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0018_geometry", "bbox": [240, 1022, 820, 1102], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0018"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_010", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0019"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0019_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Risk Evaluation: Climate risks are evaluated against organisational\nobjectives using risk appetite (set by the NDA Board) to prioritise\nresponses, ensuring consistent translation between likelihood, impact\nscores, and risk appetite tolerances. The NDA and operating companies'\nprincipal risks are collated into a climate risk log and reviewed at the\ngCRWG to identify the top climate related risks.", "semantic_text": "Risk Evaluation: Climate risks are evaluated against organisational objectives using risk appetite (set by the NDA Board) to prioritise responses, ensuring consistent translation between likelihood, impact scores, and risk appetite tolerances. The NDA and operating companies' principal risks are collated into a climate risk log and reviewed at the gCRWG to identify the top climate related risks.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0019_geometry", "bbox": [240, 1102, 812, 1224], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0019"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_011", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0020"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0020_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Risk Response: We develop action plans, allocate resources, and ensure\nbusiness stability with fallback plans for severe threats. Climate risk\nmanagement is integrated into our Business Continuity plans to prevent\nmission disruption from unforeseen events. The NDA and operating\ncompanies manage specific threats within their organisations. We are\ncurrently in the process of linking climate risks to GSRs; which will be\nconcluded in the next financial reporting period.", "semantic_text": "Risk Response: We develop action plans, allocate resources, and ensure business stability with fallback plans for severe threats. Climate risk management is integrated into our Business Continuity plans to prevent mission disruption from unforeseen events. The NDA and operating companies manage specific threats within their organisations. We are currently in the process of linking climate risks to GSRs; which will be concluded in the next financial reporting period.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0020_geometry", "bbox": [240, 1224, 810, 1363], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0020"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury_16_HY_012", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0021"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0021_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Monitor and Review: The NDA and operating companies individually oversee\ntheir respective climate risks, reviewing them according to the organisational\ngovernance requirements and the urgency of climate threats. The gCRWG\nserves as the central collaborative interface for the oversight and direction of\nprincipal climate risks, as well as a point for escalation and lessons learned.", "semantic_text": "Monitor and Review: The NDA and operating companies individually oversee their respective climate risks, reviewing them according to the organisational governance requirements and the urgency of climate threats. The gCRWG serves as the central collaborative interface for the oversight and direction of principal climate risks, as well as a point for escalation and lessons learned.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0021_geometry", "bbox": [240, 1363, 831, 1463], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0021"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_167/hybrid/short_006_tcfd_reporting_guide_2024_25_uk_treasury/page_0016/decisions.json"}
